{
  "name": "Nouvelle pièce - scan code-barres",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Avant d'utiliser ce workflow\n\n1. Créez un compte \"automation\" dans Django (voir les instructions données à part) et notez son email + mot de passe.\n2. n8n Cloud ne peut pas atteindre votre API locale (localhost) : exposez-la sur internet avec ngrok ou Cloudflare Tunnel.\n3. Ajoutez l'URL du tunnel à `ALLOWED_HOSTS` dans le `.env` du backend, sinon Django refuse la requête (DisallowedHost).\n4. Ouvrez le nœud **Config** ci-dessous et remplissez `apiBase` (URL du tunnel, sans `/` final), `email`, `password`.\n5. Cliquez **Activate** en haut du workflow pour publier le formulaire, puis ouvrez l'URL de production du nœud **Scanner le code-barres**.\n6. Scannez un code-barres, vérifiez/complétez les champs pré-remplis, validez.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "f1a1b2c3-0000-4aaa-8001-00000000000d",
      "name": "Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Nouvelle pièce — Étape 1",
        "formDescription": "Scannez ou saisissez le code-barres de la pièce pour commencer.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Code-barres",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f1a1b2c3-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000001",
      "name": "Scanner le code-barres",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "webhookId": "f1a1b2c3-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000002"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1a1a1a1-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000001",
              "name": "apiBase",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://YOUR-TUNNEL-URL.example (sans / final)"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1a1a1a1-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000002",
              "name": "email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "automation@fenina.local"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1a1a1a1-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000003",
              "name": "password",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "CHANGE_ME"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f1a1b2c3-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000003",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.apiBase }}/api/auth/login/",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"email\": \"{{ $('Config').item.json.email }}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{ $('Config').item.json.password }}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f1a1b2c3-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000004",
      "name": "Connexion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.apiBase }}/api/parts/lookup-barcode/?barcode={{ encodeURIComponent($('Scanner le code-barres').item.json['Code-barres']) }}",
        "method": "GET",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Connexion').item.json.access }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f1a1b2c3-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000005",
      "name": "Recherche code-barres",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [660, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const barcode = $('Scanner le code-barres').item.json['Code-barres'];\nconst lookup = $json;\n\nlet name = '', brand = '', category = '', oem = '', priceht = '0', location = '', note = '';\n\nif (lookup.matched && lookup.source === 'internal') {\n  const p = lookup.part;\n  name = p.name || '';\n  brand = p.brand || '';\n  category = p.category || '';\n  oem = p.oem || '';\n  priceht = (p.priceht !== undefined && p.priceht !== null) ? String(p.priceht) : '0';\n  location = p.location || '';\n  note = `Cette reference existe deja : \"${p.name}\" (SKU ${p.sku}). Verifiez avant de continuer, vous risquez de creer un doublon.`;\n} else if (lookup.matched && lookup.source === 'external') {\n  const s = lookup.suggested || {};\n  name = s.name || '';\n  brand = s.brand || '';\n  category = s.category || '';\n  note = 'Designation / marque / categorie pre-remplies automatiquement a partir du code-barres - a verifier avant de valider.';\n} else {\n  note = 'Aucune correspondance trouvee pour ce code - remplissez les champs manuellement.';\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: { barcode, name, brand, category, oem, priceht, location, note }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "f1a1b2c3-0000-4aaa-8001-000000000006",
      "name": "Préparer le pré-remplissage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [880, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Nouvelle pièce — Étape 2",
        "formDescription": "={{ $json.note }}",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "SKU",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Désignation",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "defaultValue": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Marque",
